text:
in the 80's, the business sector began phasing out U.S. workers; now, we have no retirement funds and are forced to use 401ks due to corporate greed;

if U've seen wolf of wall street, U can figure that the banking industry probably borrowed from everyone they could & ran out of options; so, they called it a stock market crash to cover up that they overspent & had nothing to replace it with; pretty sure most times they had market crashes, it was the same situation;


the biggest crime was eliminating retirement funds & tying them to the stock market; that only led to widespread theft and embezzling; U can't tell me otherwise; this damned crooks need to be forced to pay back every cent the workers lost w/ no option for bankruptcy; let the crooks see how it feels!
